triage: fix_game: Every failing scenario has the same cause: the stage-1 bid poll never offers the numbers the rules require. Seats were never offered 0, 2, 4, 5 or 6, so everyone ended up passing (mice 17, no sack taken). Numeric bids are supported, and the pass bonus and start_seat advance worked correctly, so the fault is in how the game file builds the bid options, not in the rules or the tests.
