triage: fix_game: In every failing scenario the stage-1 bid poll never offered the numbers 0 to the player's mice: seat 1 was never offered 0 or 5, and the rules for 4 and 6 were never matched. So every player was recorded as passing, gained 2 mice (17 each), and no sack was taken. The rules are clear and the engine supports numeric bids in a simultaneous poll, so this is an error in the game file.
