triage: fix_game: The rules are coherent and the platform can express them: they use simultaneous numeric polls, list operations and conditional updates. The failures come from the game file. The stage-1 poll never offered the legal values 0..mice, so every scripted bid fell back to 0 and no bidding, bonus or award happened. The setup also overwrote hands that the scenario supplied.
