triage: fix_game: The rules are sound and the platform can express them, but the game file does not implement them. In the trace the stage-1 poll never offers the range 0..mice, every bid ends up 0, and nobody bids, gains pass bonuses, wins a sack or scores cat points. Setup also seems to overwrite scenario-supplied state such as start_seat (0 -> 2 when the scenario wanted 3).

